docs/IPFS_DATASETS_PY_BATCH1_STATUS_AUDIT.md:148:- claim-support packet and trace summaries now expose `artifact_family_counts`, so review flows can distinguish archived web pages from live web pages and authority-backed artifacts without inferring from `content_origin`.
docs/IPFS_DATASETS_PY_BATCH1_STATUS_AUDIT.md:181:- passage-level provenance is present indirectly through chunk and fact linkage, but can still be made more explicit for later adverse-authority and predicate review.
