./docs/LAYPERSON_DOCKET_WORKSPACE_UI_UX_PLAN.md:327:This pass reused the same Playwright screenshots and ran two follow-up reviews:
./docs/LAYPERSON_DOCKET_WORKSPACE_UI_UX_PLAN.md:329:- Configured backend review: `artifacts/mcp-dashboard-ui-review/layperson-docket-chatbot-20260425/router-review-backend-codex.json`
