./docs/LAYPERSON_DOCKET_WORKSPACE_UI_UX_PLAN.md:415:The backend package capabilities are broader than the current layperson UX communicates. The screenshots show intake, workspace evidence, docket review, annotations, claim-support review, document building, MCP tools, and router paths, but the UI presents them as many equal-weight controls instead of one guided complaint lifecycle.
