./docs/IPFS_DATASETS_PY_DEPENDENCY_MAP.md:20:This map should be read against the current repo state, not an earlier greenfield baseline. Complaint-generator already has persisted evidence and authority facts, queue-backed scraper execution, graph-support fallback summaries, and review payloads that expose coverage plus lineage-aware follow-up plan, execution, and history summaries. The dependency question is therefore how to deepen those existing slices into a complete graph, retrieval, and reasoning system.
