./docs/IPFS_DATASETS_PY_DEPENDENCY_MAP.md:141:The scraper worker should consume queued work rather than running indefinitely without demand. This keeps archival and evidence acquisition aligned with real follow-up tasks and avoids idle scraping that produces unreviewed noise.
