docs/APPLICATIONS.md:197:- `/claim-support-review` for the operator dashboard
docs/APPLICATIONS.md:198:- `/document` for the browser-based formal complaint builder and preview surface
docs/APPLICATIONS.md:199:- `/api/claim-support/review` for read-only review payloads
